Negative for argument flow: s.audit.Record("transfer", t, err) in Service.Transfer is handed the whole (large)
transfer error as an argument, but only logs its text.
Expect exactly the 25 entries of audit_record_decl (ErrClosed, ErrFull, write errors behind "audit: write: %w") and
nothing of Transfer's own set: no "transfer %d: %w" chain, no retry, tx, rules or domain origin.
-- args --
service/service.go:@record_call
